<div class="instruction-content">
    <p>
        Min Bet, Max Bet and Max Per Match for each product are defined here.
    </p>

    <ul>
        <li>Min Bet: the minimum stake allowed on a bet.</li>
        <li>Max Bet: the maximum stake allowed on a bet.</li>
        <li>Max Per Match: the maximum stake allowed on a match.</li>
        <li>Max Per Ball: the maximum stake allowed on a ball.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
        <span class="note">Note:</span> decimal numbers are not allowed. For instance, 100.25
        is an invalid input.
    </p>
</div>